xercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "type": "audio", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le08ob07re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le08ob07re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le08ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le08ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tI can't believe we missed the first 5 innings! We should have left the restaurant earlier.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>: \t\tI apologize, Peter. I didn't know you were so enthusiastic about baseball. I had only seen sports fans on TV until I met you.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tThe Red Sox have a long history with Boston. They were one of the eight original Baseball League teams. They had won more World Series than any other team until the New York Yankees took that title from them.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>: \t\tWow, you must be really proud of your team. Personally, I always root for the underdog. I love feel-good stories in sports.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tActually, the Red Sox aren't doing so well this season. They may lose tonight. They had started to win all their games until one of their players broke his ankle and was forced to retire for the rest of the year."}, {"time": "46000", "image": "engenn8le08ob07re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>: \t\tThat can't be a good thing for the team!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\tIt isn't. He might not come back until next year.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>: \t\tI hope he recovers.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tI hope I get to see a home run!"}, {"time": "56600", "image": "engenn8le08ob07re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>: \t\tLook, Let me make up for being late. I'd like to take you to a new place in town. I had wanted to check it out before you decided on our date tonight. I think you'd like it: it's small and intimate, and the drinks are great. We could go there next Friday. Sounds good?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\tOk, sure.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rosa</span>: \t\tShall we say 8 p.m.?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\t8 p.m. sharp, please!"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}